    },
    "Applies when opening or reconnecting HTTP(S) media. Hidden queue items do not start metadata reads; buffering gives playback priority. RTSP keeps its existing settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在開啟或重新連線至HTTP(S)媒體時套用。不會讀取播放佇列中隱藏項目的中繼資料；緩衝期間會優先處理播放。RTSP會保留現有設定。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
