    "Aspect ratio stretches the picture; center crop removes edges at the display stage. Both reset when opening media and leave the original file untouched. Crop uses the final frame size, including super resolution.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "長寬比會拉伸畫面；置中裁切會在顯示階段移除邊緣。兩者都會在開啟媒體時重設，且不會更動原始檔案。裁切會以最終影格尺寸為準，包括超解析度處理後的尺寸。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
