    "Display adjustments are non-destructive and saved. Looks replace these five adjustments. Rotation may bypass native enhancement on unsupported orientations.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "顯示調整不會更動原始檔案，且設定會儲存。套用風格會取代這五項調整。旋轉至不支援的方向時，可能會略過原生畫質增強。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
