    "Frame stepping pauses playback. Backward stepping seeks and decodes again; speed and precision depend on the media and active interpolation filters.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐格移動會暫停播放。向後逐格移動會重新定位並解碼；速度與精確度取決於媒體和已啟用的補幀濾鏡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "逐格移動會暫停播放。向後逐格移動會重新定位並解碼；速度與精確度取決於媒體和已啟用的補幀濾鏡。"
          }
        },
