    "Live captions use the selected audio track on this Mac; no microphone is recorded. Recognition has a delay and does not translate. Apple language support varies. Bitmap second subtitles may keep their original position.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "即時字幕會在這部Mac上使用所選音軌，不會錄製麥克風的聲音。辨識會有延遲，且不提供翻譯。Apple對各語言的支援程度不一。點陣圖格式的第二組字幕可能會保留原始位置。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
