    "Remembers up to 100 local files. Restores embedded tracks before playback; external subtitles and live captions are not reopened automatically. Clear Recent also clears these records.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多記住100個本機檔案，並在播放前恢復內嵌軌道。外部字幕和即時字幕不會自動重新開啟。「清除最近項目」也會清除這些記錄。"
          }
