    "Requires Resume Videos Where You Left Off in General. Stores up to 100 file identity hashes and positions; credentials and temporary download URLs are not included. Reopen the file from its network browser to resume.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "需在「一般」中啟用「從上次停止處繼續播放影片」。最多儲存100個檔案識別雜湊值與播放位置，不包含憑證或暫時下載網址。從對應的網路瀏覽介面重新開啟檔案，即可繼續播放。"
          }
        },
