    "Save Server remembers this connection in macOS Keychain. WebDAV supports Basic authentication; media redirects are resolved without sending credentials to other hosts. Authenticated playlists are not supported.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「儲存伺服器」會將此連線儲存在macOS鑰匙圈中。WebDAV支援Basic驗證；處理媒體重新導向時，不會將憑證傳送至其他主機。不支援需要驗證的播放列表。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「儲存伺服器」會將此連線儲存在macOS鑰匙圈中。WebDAV支援Basic驗證；處理媒體重新導向時，不會將憑證傳送至其他主機。不支援需要驗證的播放列表。"
