    "The main window hides while video plays in the floating window. Close the mini window or press Esc to restore it. Switching uses a short fade and respects Reduce Motion.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "影片在浮動視窗中播放時，主視窗會隱藏。關閉迷你視窗或按Esc即可還原主視窗。切換時會短暫淡入淡出，並遵循「減少動態效果」設定。"
          }
        },
