    "The OpenGL presentation surface is SDR. Supported per-frame RPU is mapped on the GPU before BT.2390 tone mapping. No native Dolby Vision / EDR output or full enhancement-layer reconstruction. SDR-only neural effects are bypassed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OpenGL顯示表面為SDR。支援的各影格RPU會先在GPU上進行對應，再執行BT.2390色調對應。不提供原生Dolby Vision/EDR輸出或完整的增強層重建。僅適用於SDR的神經網路效果會略過。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
