    "Tokens stay in MSAL's application Keychain cache. Disconnect removes this app's cached login; already opened download streams can continue. No client secret is required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "權杖會保存在MSAL的應用程式鑰匙圈快取中。中斷連線會移除此App快取的登入資料；已開啟的下載串流仍可繼續。無需用戶端密碼。"
          }
        },
