    },
    "Up to %llds ahead, %lld MiB forward / %lld MiB backward packet budgets per player window. Actual buffering also depends on bitrate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個播放器視窗最多預先緩衝%1$lld秒，前向%2$lld MiB/後向%3$lld MiB封包配額。實際緩衝量亦取決於位元率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個播放器視窗最多預先緩衝%1$lld秒，前向%2$lld MiB/後向%3$lld MiB封包配額。實際緩衝量亦取決於位元率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個播放器視窗最多預先緩衝%1$lld秒，前向%2$lld MiB/後向%3$lld MiB封包配額。實際緩衝量亦取決於位元率。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每個播放器視窗最多預先緩衝%1$lld秒，前向%2$lld MiB/後向%3$lld MiB封包配額。實際緩衝量亦取決於位元率。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use ⌥⌘P to enter or restore. Double-click or Esc always restores the normal player. Controls hide according to the viewing preference above.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按⌥⌘P可進入迷你播放器或還原。按兩下或按Esc一律會還原一般播放器。控制項會依照上方的觀看偏好設定隱藏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按⌥⌘P可進入迷你播放器或還原。按兩下或按Esc一律會還原一般播放器。控制項會依照上方的觀看偏好設定隱藏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant-HK": {
          "stringUnit": {
